{% extends 'layout/shell.twig' %}

{#
  ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
  `/` — THE HOMEPAGE · Phase 4 · HomePageV3.dc.html + WeAreAfrica.dc.html (§8.1)
  ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

  Written from the DC after the old page was destroyed (inventory:
  docs/handoff/inventory/pages--home.md). §8.1's order, with what this page does at each:

    1 Hero ................ drawn. The record card is a real decided award (HomeFront)
    2 Live stats .......... drawn, four counts (HomeFront::stats)
    3 "Who recognises" .... drawn (Phase 6): partials/who-recognises.twig, its record cards
                            from Services\Recognitions — announced awards only
    4 Wall of recognition . NOT DRAWN — needs testimonials (GAPS §3.5)
    5 We Are Africa ....... drawn on GlobeBand's markers (partials/we-are-africa.twig)
    6 Happening now ....... drawn: voting open + just decided; a column with nothing is not
    7 Giving .............. drawn when one campaign is open (HomeFront::campaign)
    8 Recognise band ...... drawn with only what the platform offers today
    9 Footer .............. the shell's (partials/site-footer.twig)

  Section 4 is a blocked question for the owner, not a placeholder: the DC's content for it
  is quotes from people, and this platform has neither the records nor the consent to show
  one (docs/handoff/PHASE-4.md, "Home"). Section 3 is drawn since Phase 6 from real
  recognitions — never the DC's "National Honours Office" (docs/handoff/PHASE-6.md). Nothing on this page is a DC figure.

  ── WHAT A PHOTO SLOT SHOWS WITH NO REAL PHOTO (GAPS Q8, ANSWERED 4 OCT 2026) ──

  No stock photography (REFERENCE §14). Every slot goes through `partials/photo.twig`,
  the one answer: a person with no photo is a monogram, a thing (a programme, a
  campaign) a generated cover. A partner's logo is shown as a logo. Only when there is no
  decided award at all does the hero show the continent's outline — that is decoration
  in an empty slot, not a photo standing in for somebody.

  Colour tier 2 (transactional: it asks to nominate and to give): green is the call to
  action, live is "voting open". Gold is spent nowhere here — the decided rows say
  "Winner" in words and their initials sit on the neutral tint (ColourBudgetTest).
#}

{% set colour_tier = '2' %}
{% set app_bar = {variant: 'root', title: 'Africa GATES', brand: true} %}
{# A winner with a photograph leads; with none, the award's own cover stands in — never
   a 400px monogram, which reads as a placeholder where the page's first picture belongs
   (design review, 12 Oct 2026). #}
{% set _hero = (decided|filter(d => d.photo)|first) ?: (decided|first) %}

{% block head_styles %}
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="{{ asset('/assets/css/components/home.css') }}">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="{{ asset('/assets/css/components/photo.css') }}">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="{{ asset('/assets/css/components/who-recognises.css') }}">
{% endblock %}

{% block content %}
<div class="hm">

  {# ── 1 · Hero ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── #}
  <section class="hm-hero" aria-labelledby="hm-h1">
    <div class="hm-hero__text">
      <h1 class="hm-hero__h1" id="hm-h1">{{ 'Where Africa recognises its people'|trans }}</h1>
      <p class="hm-hero__lead">{{ 'Nominate the people who make a difference, vote for them, and see every award decided in the open and kept on the record.'|trans }}</p>
      <div class="hm-hero__ctas">
        <a class="hm-cta hm-cta--go" href="/nominate">{{ 'Nominate someone'|trans }}</a>
        <a class="hm-cta hm-cta--line" href="#hm-host">{{ 'Recognise with Africa GATES'|trans }}</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="hm-hero__media">
      {% if _hero %}
        {% if _hero.photo %}
          {% include 'partials/photo.twig' with {kind: 'person', src: _hero.photo|media_url('portrait'), name: _hero.name, size: 160, alt: 'Photo of %name%'|trans({'%name%': _hero.name}), eager: true} only %}
        {% else %}
          {% include 'partials/photo.twig' with {kind: 'thing', subject: 'award', src: '', name: _hero.programme ?: _hero.name} only %}
        {% endif %}
      {% else %}
        <img class="hm-hero__mark" src="{{ asset('/assets/img/africa-silhouette.svg') }}" alt="" aria-hidden="true">
      {% endif %}
      {% if _hero %}
        <a class="hm-rec" href="{{ _hero.url }}">
          <span class="hm-rec__who">
            <span class="hm-av hm-av--44" aria-hidden="true">{% include 'partials/photo.twig' with {kind: 'person', src: _hero.photo ? _hero.photo|media_url('avatar') : '', name: _hero.name, ini: _hero.ini} only %}</span>
            <span class="hm-rec__t"><span class="hm-rec__n">{{ _hero.name }}</span><span class="hm-rec__s">{{ _hero.category }}</span></span>
          </span>
          <span class="hm-rec__by">
            <span class="hm-rec__tile" aria-hidden="true">{{ _hero.programme|first|upper }}</span>
            <span class="hm-rec__issuer">{{ (_hero.programme ~ ' ' ~ _hero.edition)|trim }}</span>
            <span class="hm-rec__chip">{{ 'Winner'|trans }}</span>
          </span>
        </a>
      {% endif %}
    </div>
  </section>

  {# ── 2 · Live stats — counted (HomeFront::stats), never the DC's figures ──── #}
  <section class="hm-stats" aria-label="{{ 'Live now'|trans }}">
    <div class="hm-stat"><span class="hm-stat__n">{{ stats.nominations_open|number_format }}</span><span class="hm-stat__l">{{ (stats.nominations_open == 1 ? 'edition open for nominations' : 'editions open for nominations')|trans }}</span></div>
    <div class="hm-stat"><span class="hm-stat__n">{{ stats.voting_open|number_format }}</span><span class="hm-stat__l">{{ (stats.voting_open == 1 ? 'vote happening now' : 'votes happening now')|trans }}</span></div>
    <div class="hm-stat"><span class="hm-stat__n">{{ stats.nations|number_format }}</span><span class="hm-stat__l">{{ (stats.nations == 1 ? 'country taking part' : 'countries taking part')|trans }}</span></div>
    <div class="hm-stat"><span class="hm-stat__n">{{ stats.votes|number_format }}</span><span class="hm-stat__l">{{ (stats.votes == 1 ? 'vote cast' : 'votes cast')|trans }}</span></div>
  </section>

  {# ── 3 · Who recognises (Phase 6) ─────────────────────────────────────── #}
  {% include 'partials/who-recognises.twig' with {recognitions: recognitions|default([])} only %}

  {# ── 2 · Who do you want to honour? ────────────────────────────────────── #}
  <section class="hm-sec" aria-labelledby="hm-honour-h">
    <div class="hm-head hm-head--row">
      <h2 class="hm-h2" id="hm-honour-h">{{ 'Who do you want to honour?'|trans }}</h2>
      <a class="hm-more hm-more--lg" href="/nominate">{{ 'All categories →'|trans }}</a>
    </div>
    {% set honour_tiles = [
      { key: 'teacher', label: 'Teacher or mentor', img: asset('/assets/honour/teacher.png') },
      { key: 'nurse', label: 'Nurse or carer', img: asset('/assets/honour/nurse.png') },
      { key: 'community-leader', label: 'Community leader', img: asset('/assets/honour/community-leader.png') },
      { key: 'creative', label: 'Creative or artist', img: asset('/assets/honour/creative.png') },
      { key: 'business', label: 'Business builder', img: asset('/assets/honour/business.png') },
      { key: 'young-leader', label: 'Young leader', img: asset('/assets/honour/young-leader.png') }
    ] %}
    <div class="hm-honour-grid">
      {% for t in honour_tiles %}
        <a class="hm-honour-tile" href="/nominate?category={{ t.key }}">
          <div class="hm-honour-tile__img-wrap">
            <img class="hm-honour-tile__img" src="{{ t.img }}" alt="{{ t.label }}" loading="lazy">
          </div>
          <div class="hm-honour-tile__body">
            <span class="hm-honour-tile__lbl">{{ t.label|trans }}</span>
            <span class="hm-honour-tile__arr" aria-hidden="true">
              <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg>
            </span>
          </div>
        </a>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </section>

  {# ── 3 · Featured ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────── #}
  <section class="hm-sec" aria-labelledby="hm-feat-h">
    <div class="hm-head">
      <span class="hm-eyebrow">{{ 'Featured'|trans }}</span>
      <h2 class="hm-h2" id="hm-feat-h">{{ 'Stories and spotlights across Africa'|trans }}</h2>
    </div>

    {% set wide = featured_wide ?: {
      title: 'The Great African Education Challenge',
      body: 'Celebrating teachers and innovators creating accessible education across the continent.',
      image_path: '',
      tag: 'Challenge',
      link_url: '/challenges',
      link_text: 'Join the challenge →'
    } %}
    <div class="hm-feat-wide">
      <div class="hm-feat-wide__media">
        <span class="hm-feat-wide__tag">{{ wide.tag|trans }}</span>
        {% if wide.image_path %}<img src="{{ wide.image_path }}" alt="{{ wide.title }}" loading="lazy">{% endif %}
      </div>
      <div class="hm-feat-wide__body">
        <h3 class="hm-feat-wide__t">{{ wide.title|trans }}</h3>
        <p class="hm-feat-wide__p">{{ wide.body|trans }}</p>
        <a class="hm-feat-wide__link" href="{{ wide.link_url ?: '/challenges' }}">{{ wide.link_text ?: 'Join the challenge →'|trans }}</a>
      </div>
    </div>

    {% set default_topics = [
      {
        title: 'New recognition formats for 2026',
        body: 'How organisations use Africa GATES to verify honours.',
        tag: 'New',
        field_bg: '#f3d98b',
        rot: '-3deg',
        image: '',
        url: '/blog'
      },
      {
        title: 'Run an award for your community',
        body: 'Tools for organisers, universities and civic groups.',
        tag: 'For organisers',
        field_bg: '#bcd4e6',
        rot: '4deg',
        image: '',
        url: '/partner'
      },
      {
        title: 'Wear the recognition',
        body: 'Every order gives back 40% to youth development.',
        tag: 'Shop',
        field_bg: '#f1c9d3',
        rot: '-2deg',
        image: '',
        url: '/shop'
      }
    ] %}
    {% set topics = topic_cards|length ? topic_cards : default_topics %}
    <div class="hm-topics-grid">
      {% for top in topics %}
        <a class="hm-topic-card" href="{{ top.url ?: top.link_url ?: '#' }}">
          <div class="hm-topic-card__field" style="background: {{ top.field_bg ?: '#f3d98b' }}">
            <span class="hm-topic-card__tag">{{ top.tag|trans }}</span>
            <div class="hm-topic-card__photo-wrap" style="transform: rotate({{ top.rot ?: '0deg' }})">
              {% if top.image or top.image_path %}<img src="{{ top.image ?: top.image_path }}" alt="{{ top.title }}" loading="lazy">{% endif %}
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="hm-topic-card__body">
            <h4 class="hm-topic-card__t">{{ top.title|trans }}</h4>
            <p class="hm-topic-card__p">{{ (top.body ?: top.quote)|trans }}</p>
          </div>
        </a>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </section>

  {# ── 4 · How it works ───────────────────────────────────────────────────── #}
  <section class="hm-sec" aria-labelledby="hm-hiw-h">
    <div class="hm-head">
      <span class="hm-eyebrow">{{ 'How it works'|trans }}</span>
      <h2 class="hm-h2" id="hm-hiw-h">{{ 'Transparent, community-driven recognition'|trans }}</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="hm-hiw-grid">
      <div class="hm-hiw-card">
        <span class="hm-hiw-card__num">01</span>
        <h3 class="hm-hiw-card__t">{{ 'Nominate & put people forward'|trans }}</h3>
        <p class="hm-hiw-card__p">{{ 'Anyone can nominate someone doing outstanding work. No fee to nominate or accept.'|trans }}</p>
      </div>
      <div class="hm-hiw-card">
        <span class="hm-hiw-card__num">02</span>
        <h3 class="hm-hiw-card__t">{{ 'Community voting & verification'|trans }}</h3>
        <p class="hm-hiw-card__p">{{ 'Verified citizens vote across categories. Integrity systems ensure one voter, one vote.'|trans }}</p>
      </div>
      <div class="hm-hiw-card">
        <span class="hm-hiw-card__num">03</span>
        <h3 class="hm-hiw-card__t">{{ 'Permanent record & celebration'|trans }}</h3>
        <p class="hm-hiw-card__p">{{ 'Honours and awards are recorded permanently in the Legacy Vault for generations.'|trans }}</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  {# ── 5 · We Are Africa ─────────────────────────────────────────────────── #}
  <div class="hm-bleed">{% include 'partials/we-are-africa.twig' with {countries: globe_countries, note: globe_note} only %}</div>

  {# ── 6 · Happening now ─────────────────────────────────────────────────── #}
  {% if voting.rows|length or decided|length %}
  <section class="hm-sec" aria-labelledby="hm-now">
    <div class="hm-head">
      <span class="hm-eyebrow">{{ 'Happening now'|trans }}</span>
      <h2 class="hm-h2" id="hm-now">{{ 'Live across the continent'|trans }}</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="hm-now">
      {% if voting.rows|length %}
      <section class="hm-now__col" aria-labelledby="hm-vote">
        <div class="hm-now__hd">
          <h3 class="hm-h3" id="hm-vote"><span class="hm-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>{{ 'Voting open'|trans }}</h3>
          <a class="hm-more" href="/vote">{{ 'All %n%'|trans({'%n%': voting.total|number_format}) }}</a>
        </div>
        <ul class="hm-list">
          {% for v in voting.rows %}
          <li><a class="hm-row" href="{{ v.url }}">
            <span class="hm-thumb" aria-hidden="true">{% include 'partials/photo.twig' with {kind: 'thing', subject: 'award', src: v.cover ? v.cover|media_url('thumb') : '', name: v.title} only %}</span>
            <span class="hm-row__t"><span class="hm-row__n">{{ v.title }}</span>{% if v.meta %}<span class="hm-row__m">{{ v.meta }}</span>{% endif %}</span>
            {% if v.left %}<span class="hm-row__left">{{ v.left }}</span>{% endif %}
          </a></li>
          {% endfor %}
        </ul>
      </section>
      {% endif %}
      {% if decided|length %}
      <section class="hm-now__col" aria-labelledby="hm-dec">
        <div class="hm-now__hd">
          <h3 class="hm-h3" id="hm-dec">{{ 'Just decided'|trans }}</h3>
          <a class="hm-more" href="/results">{{ 'Results'|trans }}</a>
        </div>
        <ul class="hm-list">
          {% for d in decided %}
          <li><a class="hm-row hm-row--dec" href="{{ d.url }}">
            <span class="hm-av hm-av--44" aria-hidden="true">{% include 'partials/photo.twig' with {kind: 'person', src: d.photo ? d.photo|media_url('avatar') : '', name: d.name, ini: d.ini} only %}</span>
            <span class="hm-row__t"><span class="hm-row__n hm-row__n--sm">{{ d.name }}</span><span class="hm-row__m hm-row__m--one">{{ 'Winner'|trans }} · {{ d.what }}</span></span>
          </a></li>
          {% endfor %}
        </ul>
      </section>
      {% endif %}
    </div>
  </section>
  {% endif %}

  {# ── 7 · Giving — one campaign, the open one closing soonest ────────────── #}
  {% if campaign %}
  <section class="hm-sec" aria-labelledby="hm-give">
    <div class="hm-head hm-head--row">
      <div class="hm-head">
        <span class="hm-eyebrow">{{ 'Giving'|trans }}</span>
        <h2 class="hm-h2" id="hm-give">{{ 'Back the programmes that grow Africa’s next leaders'|trans }}</h2>
      </div>
      <a class="hm-more hm-more--lg" href="/giving">{{ 'See all campaigns'|trans }}</a>
    </div>
    <a class="hm-give" href="{{ campaign.url }}">
      <span class="hm-give__media">
        {% if campaign.logo %}<img class="hm-give__logo" src="{{ campaign.logo }}" alt="{{ campaign.org }}">{% else %}{% include 'partials/photo.twig' with {kind: 'thing', subject: 'campaign', src: '', name: campaign.org} only %}{% endif %}
      </span>
      <span class="hm-give__body">
        <span class="hm-give__org">{{ campaign.org }}</span>
        <span class="hm-give__t">{{ campaign.title }}</span>
        <span class="hm-give__prog">
          {% if campaign.goal %}<span class="hm-give__bar"><span aria-hidden="true" style="--hm-pct:{{ campaign.pct }}%"></span><span class="hm-vh">{{ '%pct%% of the goal'|trans({'%pct%': campaign.pct}) }}</span></span>{% endif %}
          <span class="hm-give__sum"><strong>{{ campaign.raised }}</strong> <span>{{ campaign.goal ? 'raised of %goal%'|trans({'%goal%': campaign.goal}) : 'raised'|trans }}</span></span>
        </span>
        <span class="hm-cta hm-cta--give">{{ 'Give'|trans }}</span>
      </span>
    </a>
  </section>
  {% endif %}

  {# ── 8 · Recognise band — only what the platform offers today ───────────── #}
  <section class="hm-host" id="hm-host" aria-labelledby="hm-host-h" tabindex="-1">
    <div class="hm-host__text">
      <span class="hm-host__eyebrow">{{ 'For organisations, businesses and governments'|trans }}</span>
      <h2 class="hm-h2" id="hm-host-h">{{ 'Recognise with Africa GATES'|trans }}</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="hm-host__side">
      <ul class="hm-host__points">
        <li><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 10.5 8.5 15 16 5.5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg>{{ 'Awards with editions, categories and public voting'|trans }}</li>
      </ul>
      <div class="hm-host__ctas"><a class="hm-pill hm-pill--line" href="/partner">{{ 'Talk to us'|trans }}</a></div>
    </div>
  </section>

</div>
{% endblock %}

{% block foot_scripts %}
  <script defer src="{{ asset('/assets/js/we-are-africa.js') }}"></script>
  <script defer src="{{ asset('/assets/js/who-recognises.js') }}"></script>
{% endblock %}
